{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/983922-the-adherants-of-blood-flowing-as-water","id":983922,"title":"The Adherants of Blood Flowing As Water","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-08T07:59:49-07:00","id":983922,"title":"The Adherants of Blood Flowing As Water","content":"I'm about to play a vampire game where I'm playing as an acolyte who is a part of a cult (leader actually) that is sort of a hidden secondary cult within the main cult of the circle in the city. Writing up the cult has made me wonder what other vampire cults people have made. The cult is one that worships a high ranking blood spirit who goes by many names, though the most typically used is Blood Flowing As Water.<br /> <br /> As for the actual writeup:<br /> <br /> <b>The Adherants of Blood Flowing As Water</b><br /> <br /> Adherants to our God have come to us out of a realization or epiphany that there is something beyond our normal perceptions of the world. We are the followers of blood itself, the physical perfected form of all lifesblood. When you join us you sacrifice much, your limits are the first to go and your life might follow shortly after those.<br /> <br /> <b>First dot:</b> An adherant at this level may be anything; a human, a ghoul, a recently indoctrinated vampire or some other supernatural being such as a werewolf or sin-eater. At this stage the adherant is only aware of the nature of the group so far as they are worshippers of an animist religion that sees blood as one of the more sacred and powerful forces in the world. At this stage the adherant gains a skill specialty related to spirits in occult as a part of the basic teachings of the group impart some knowledge of the true nature of spirits onto adherants.<br /> <br /> <b>Second dot:</b> At this point adherants are shown some more of the nature of their God, knowing that it is a powerful spirit of blood that often takes the form of an enormous snake which appears to be made out of dried blood when still but resembles a river of blood flowing when it is in motion. Blood Flowing As Water will often take other forms, including that of a bat or a mishapen ball of blood that shifts and warps rapidly. Adherants from this point are only allowed to be ghouls or vampires, as these types of creature have a much more intimate knowledge of what it is to be required to spill blood in order to survive. I haven't actually figured out what to put at this level of initiation, I've considered contacts or a physical merit, or area of expertise (spirits).<br /> <br /> <b>Third dot:</b> This is the stage that adherants are introduced to Blood Flowing As Water, typically involving a rather frenzied ritual where the adherant is taken into the shadow in order to meet their God. To actually attain this level of initiation an adherant has to be a vampire, any ghoul or human prospects with lower levels of initiation must be embraced before they are able to achieve this level of initiation. When an adherant reaches this stage they are shown beyond any doubt that there is a realm that sits beside ours where spirits truly exist and that their God is one of these spirits, albeit a powerful one. This level of mystery cult initiation grants an adherant a dot of the survival skill due to the harrowing time spent in the shadow during their initiation to this rank, as well the cult becomes willing to teach adherants the discipline of Blood Tenebrous when they reach this level (I am using a modified version of Claire Redfield's <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/693721-blood-tenebrous-2e\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...d-tenebrous-2e</a> update for this), before adherants reach this level the cult refuses to teach the discipline and considers anyone who is not an adherant of at least this level to be unworthy of the discipline (typically responding with violence when they discover a non-adherant who has knowledge of the discipline). <br /> <br /> <b>Fourth dot:</b> At this stage the adherant becomes known as a priest or priestess of Blood Flowing As Water and has a choice between two benefits, first they can take a weak blood spirit as their personal totem (mechanically a 3 dot totem). A blessing from their god that watches over them and typically pushes the adherant to spill blood as much as possible and as often as possible. Otherwise the adherant is able to gain 3 dots worth of contacts or allies related to the spirits allied with Blood Flowing As Water (that is to say, blood spirits and related spirits), these dots can be split as the adherant wishes.<br /> <br /> <b>Fifth dot:</b> This is the level of the high priests and priestesses, typically only a very small number of adherants even have a chance of reaching this level, only the most dedicated and brutal adherants are suited to it. Blood Flowing As Water shows greater favour to and expects a lot from their highest ranking adherants, granting either a weak spirit, or empowering a previously earned one, to act as the personal totem of the adherant, (either granting a 3 dot totem, or if one was chosen at the fourth dot level then it is strengthened to a 6 dot totem). To reach this stage typically an adhernat must be able to enter the shadow at a locus without assistance (3 dots of blood tenebrous or higher).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}